SteinOS — Green Edition (parody project)

SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later

This is a parody/commentary OS branding project based on AcreetionOS
(https://acreetionos.org, GPL-3.0-or-later) and Arch Linux. All OS
machinery, build scripts, and base packages remain under their original
licenses (GPL-3.0 / GPL-2.0 / MIT etc. per package).

Political figure names, likenesses, and party slogans are used in
satire. This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected
to any campaign, party, or candidate. "Make Linux Great Again" is a
parody of "Make America Great Again".

You are free to fork, modify, and redistribute this branding per the
GPL-3.0-or-later terms. The full license text is at:
https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html
